## 14. Conclusion

The Smart Crop Recommendation System demonstrates how Java and OOP principles (classes, objects, encapsulation, constructors, collections, exception handling) can be applied to solve a practical agricultural problem — comparing soil/environmental inputs against crop ranges to generate a data-driven recommendation.
